<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>靠谱螃蟹 · 沙滩与程序化表面 R11</title><style>
:root{color-scheme:dark;--bg:#0c171c;--panel:#14232b;--line:#2a414a;--text:#e1eeeb;--muted:#9cb4b7;--accent:#92ddbe}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font:14px "Segoe UI","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif}button,input,select{font:inherit}button{cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;background:#1a2e36;color:#bcced0;padding:9px 13px;transition:background .12s,border-color .12s}button:hover{background:#27434a;border-color:#6b9d99;color:#fff}button.selected,button[aria-pressed=true]{color:#d9fff0;border-color:#72c6a6;background:#244c40}button:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible,input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:3px}button:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:default}header{height:76px;padding:0 24px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);gap:12px}h1{margin:0 0 5px;font-size:20px;font-weight:600}header p{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin:0}.tag{font-size:11px;white-space:nowrap;color:#beecd7;border:1px solid #416e5b;border-radius:20px;padding:7px 11px}.layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 340px;height:calc(100dvh - 164px);min-height:0}main{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-width:0;min-height:0}.scene-nav{height:88px;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:16px 20px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.scene-nav .nav-caption{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-right:4px}.scene-choice{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;min-width:164px;text-align:left;padding:11px 16px}.scene-choice b{font-size:14px;display:block}.scene-choice small{display:block;margin-top:4px;font-size:10px;color:#a9c4bb}.scene-icon{font-size:22px;line-height:1}.toolbar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:12px 20px}.group{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}.toolbar button{font-size:12px;padding:8px 11px}#open-surface{border-color:#647d70;color:#d7e8be}.focus-caption{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);align-self:center;margin-right:2px}#viewport{position:relative;flex:1;min-height:220px;overflow:hidden}canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;touch-action:none}.scene-badge{position:absolute;top:16px;left:18px;z-index:2;pointer-events:none;border:1px solid #ffffff30;border-radius:10px;padding:9px 12px;background:#132d2bd9;color:#e9fff4;font-size:11px;backdrop-filter:blur(6px)}.scene-badge strong{display:block;font-size:12px}.scene-badge small{display:block;max-width:330px;margin-top:5px;line-height:1.5;color:#c0d9d0}.labels{position:absolute;bottom:16px;left:18px;right:18px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px;pointer-events:none}.label{padding:9px 12px;border-radius:9px;background:#0e2528da;max-width:300px}.label strong{font-size:12px;display:block}.label small{display:block;font-size:10px;color:#acc8c7;margin-top:5px;line-height:1.5}.label strong:before{content:"";display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;margin-right:7px;background:var(--accent);border-radius:50%}.divider{position:absolute;left:50%;top:10px;bottom:10px;border-left:1px solid var(--line);pointer-events:none}#viewport[data-stage=beach] .divider{display:none}#viewport[data-stage=beach] .labels{display:flex;justify-content:space-between}#viewport[data-mode=ordinary] .coconut,#viewport[data-mode=coconut] .ordinary,#viewport[data-mode=ordinary] .divider,#viewport[data-mode=coconut] .divider{display:none}#loading{position:absolute;inset:0;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--bg);color:var(--accent);z-index:5}#loading[hidden]{display:none}.playbar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;padding:10px 20px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);background:#112129}.playbar .control{margin:0;gap:12px}.playbar button{padding:7px 15px}.hint{font-size:10px;color:#94afb3;padding:10px 20px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}#status{font-size:11px;color:#b9ecd4}.control{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:14px;font-size:12px;color:#bed0d0}.control input[type=range]{width:52%;accent-color:#91dabb}.control output{min-width:34px;text-align:right}.control label{flex:none}aside{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-width:0;min-height:0;background:var(--panel);border-left:1px solid var(--line)}.inspector-header{padding:19px 19px 13px}.eyebrow{font-size:10px;color:#9ec7ba;letter-spacing:.14em}.inspector-header h2{font-size:16px;margin:8px 0 4px}.inspector-header p{font-size:11px;margin:0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}.panel-tabs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:5px;padding:0 13px 13px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.panel-tabs button{font-size:12px;padding:9px 3px}.panel-scroll{overflow:auto;min-height:0;flex:1;padding:0 18px 20px}[data-panel][hidden]{display:none}.section{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:18px;margin-top:18px}.section:first-child{border-top:0;margin-top:0}h2{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 12px;color:#d4e6df}.bodytext,.tooltip{font-size:11px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--muted)}.behaviors{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:6px}.behaviors button{font-size:11px;padding:10px 4px}.views{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:6px}.views button{font-size:11px;padding:9px 4px}label.check{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;font-size:12px;margin-top:14px;color:#b7cccc}input[type=checkbox]{accent-color:var(--accent)}.metrics{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);line-height:2}.metrics b{font-weight:400;color:#d3e3df}.note{font-size:10px;color:#8aa4a8;line-height:1.8}select{width:100%;margin-top:9px;border:1px solid #44616a;background:#1b3039;color:#d8e8e2;padding:10px;border-radius:8px}details{margin-top:15px;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.8}summary{cursor:pointer;color:#bfdacf}a{color:#abdaca}.skin-group{padding-top:14px;margin-top:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.skin-group h3{font-size:12px;margin:0 0 9px}.skin-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:6px}.skin-card{min-width:0;padding:9px 4px;font-size:10px;text-align:center}.skin-preview{display:block;height:26px;border-radius:6px;margin:0 4px 8px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--swatch-low),var(--swatch-high));border:1px solid #ffffff35}.skin-card .choice-check{font-size:9px;color:#aec8bb;display:block;margin-top:6px;min-height:12px}.skin-card.selected .choice-check{color:#ceffe3}.sr-only{position:absolute!important;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);white-space:nowrap;border:0}.tune-box{padding:13px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:#102129;margin-top:18px}.tune-box h2{margin:0;font-size:12px}#skin-selection-status{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:10px;line-height:1.7;color:#b1d6c2}.plain-button{width:100%;margin-top:12px}.surface-hint{padding:9px 11px;background:#203b34;border-radius:8px;color:#c0e6d4}.stage-note{padding:11px 13px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;margin-top:14px}.panel-footer{margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px}
@media(max-width:1050px){.layout{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 305px}.toolbar{padding:10px 14px}.scene-nav{padding:12px 14px}.scene-choice{min-width:146px;padding:10px 12px}.focus-caption{display:none}.scene-nav .nav-caption{display:none}.scene-badge small{max-width:240px}.toolbar button{padding:7px 9px}}
@media(max-width:700px){header{height:70px;padding:0 14px}h1{font-size:16px}header p{font-size:10px}.tag{font-size:10px;padding:6px 8px}.layout{display:flex;flex-direction:column;height:auto}main{min-height:0}.scene-nav{height:80px;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:10;background:var(--bg);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;padding:10px 12px;gap:8px}.scene-choice{min-width:0;padding:10px;justify-content:center}.scene-choice b{font-size:13px}.scene-choice small{font-size:9px}.scene-icon{font-size:18px}.toolbar{padding:10px 12px;justify-content:center}.toolbar .group{justify-content:center}.toolbar button{font-size:10px;padding:7px 9px}#viewport{flex:none;height:450px;min-height:0}#viewport[data-mode=both][data-stage=lab]{height:640px}#viewport[data-stage=lab][data-mode=both] .labels{display:block;inset:0 12px 12px}#viewport[data-stage=lab][data-mode=both] .label{position:absolute;left:0;bottom:calc(50% + 12px)}#viewport[data-stage=lab][data-mode=both] .label.coconut{bottom:0}.divider{left:10px;right:10px;top:50%;bottom:auto;border-left:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.labels{left:12px;right:12px;bottom:12px;gap:7px}.label{padding:8px;max-width:48%}.label strong{font-size:10px}.label small{font-size:9px}.scene-badge{top:12px;left:12px;right:12px;width:max-content;max-width:calc(100% - 24px)}.scene-badge small{max-width:290px;font-size:10px}.playbar{padding:10px 12px;flex-wrap:wrap}.playbar .control{flex:1;min-width:180px}.playbar .control input{width:50%}.hint{text-align:center;font-size:9px;padding:9px}aside{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.panel-scroll{overflow:visible;padding:0 16px 18px}.panel-tabs{position:sticky;top:80px;background:var(--panel);z-index:9}.inspector-header{padding:17px 16px 12px}.inspector-header h2{font-size:15px}.skin-card{font-size:12px}.skin-preview{height:32px}.control input[type=range]{width:55%}.label:only-child{max-width:100%}}
</style></head><body><header><div><h1>靠谱螃蟹 · 生活与外观</h1><p>同一片沙滩，两只蟹，各自三套程序化表面</p></div><span class="tag">R11 · 关节约束</span></header><nav class="scene-nav" aria-label="选择场景"><span class="nav-caption">场景</span><button class="scene-choice selected" data-stage="beach" aria-pressed="true"><span class="scene-icon" aria-hidden="true">☀</span><span><b>沙滩生活</b><small>海边漫游 · 自动活动</small></span></button><button class="scene-choice" data-stage="lab" aria-pressed="false"><span class="scene-icon" aria-hidden="true">◎</span><span><b>骨骼工作台</b><small>近看形体 · 检查关节</small></span></button></nav><div class="layout"><main>

<div class="toolbar"><div class="group" aria-label="查看模型"><span class="focus-caption">查看</span><button class="selected" data-mode="both" aria-pressed="true">两只一起</button><button data-mode="ordinary" aria-pressed="false">普通螃蟹</button><button data-mode="coconut" aria-pressed="false">椰子蟹</button><button id="open-surface">选表面 · 每只 3 套</button></div><div class="group" aria-label="显示方式"><button class="selected" data-display="shell">自然外观</button><button data-display="clay">形体</button><button data-display="regions">区块分色</button><button data-display="weights">蒙皮权重</button></div></div>
<div id="viewport" data-mode="both" data-stage="beach"><canvas aria-label="两只程序化螃蟹的实时三维活动"></canvas><div class="scene-badge"><strong id="scene-title">当前场景：沙滩生活</strong><small id="scene-description">已进入海边沙地；步速与落脚同步，停稳后观察与探索。</small></div><div class="labels"><div class="label ordinary"><strong>普通螃蟹</strong><small>红褐颗粒 · 程序化表面</small></div><div class="label coconut"><strong>椰子蟹</strong><small>蓝紫甲壳 · 程序化表面</small></div></div><div class="divider"></div><div id="loading">正在生成完整曲面、沙滩与骨架…</div></div>
<div class="playbar"><div class="group"><button id="pause">暂停</button><button id="reset">复位视角</button></div><div class="control"><label for="speed">动作速度</label><input id="speed" type="range" min="0.25" max="3" step="0.05" value="1.65"><output id="speed-value">1.65×</output></div><span id="status" role="status">自然活动 · 运行中</span></div><div class="hint">拖动旋转 · 滚轮缩放 · 右键平移 · 双指缩放 · 点击椰子蟹检查区块</div></main>
<aside aria-label="螃蟹设置"><div class="inspector-header"><div class="eyebrow">CRAB / LIVE WORKBENCH</div><h2>观察与调整</h2><p>先选场景，再选模型。每只蟹的表面可独立切换。</p></div><nav class="panel-tabs" aria-label="设置分类"><button class="selected" data-tab="surface" aria-pressed="true">表面</button><button data-tab="activity" aria-pressed="false">活动</button><button data-tab="rig" aria-pressed="false">骨骼</button><button data-tab="view" aria-pressed="false">视角</button></nav><div class="panel-scroll">
<section data-panel="surface"><div class="section" id="crab-skin-panel"><h2>程序化表面 <span style="color:#9ab7a9;font-size:11px;font-weight:400">每只 3 套</span></h2><p class="tooltip surface-hint">点选下方方案，立即查看颜色、花纹和肌理。两只蟹分别保留自己的设置。</p><div id="skin-choice-mount"></div><p id="skin-selection-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div><div class="tune-box"><h2>微调哪一只</h2><select id="skin-target" aria-label="表面微调对象"><option value="ordinary">普通螃蟹</option><option value="coconut" selected>椰子蟹</option></select><div class="control"><label for="tone">颜色深浅</label><input id="tone" type="range" min="0" max="1" step="0.02" value="0.5"></div><div class="control"><label for="variation">细斑对比</label><input id="variation" type="range" min="0" max="1" step="0.02" value="0.5"></div><div class="control"><label for="detail">颗粒肌理</label><input id="detail" type="range" min="0" max="1" step="0.02" value="0.5"></div><div class="control"><label for="gloss">甲壳光泽</label><input id="gloss" type="range" min="0" max="1" step="0.02" value="0.5"></div><button id="individual" class="plain-button">换一个自然个体</button><button id="skin-reset" class="plain-button">恢复当前方案的参数</button><p class="tooltip" id="individual-status"></p></div><details class="references"><summary>自然参考与实现边界</summary><p>普通模型物种待核实，沿用 <a href="https://www.fisheries.noaa.gov/species/jonah-crab" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NOAA 实物照片</a>约束的细斑与颜色范围。</p><p>椰子蟹核对 <a href="https://christmasislandnationalpark.gov.au/discover/nature/animals/crabs/robber-crab/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">澳洲国家公园照片</a>与<a href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/30170743/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">红、蓝色型研究</a>。深棕是红棕族内的工程变化，不宣称第三个生物学色型。</p><p>无图片纹理。颜色、细斑、粗糙度和微表面通过函数生成；完整形体仍来自参考测量，程序化表示和改色不等同于独立原创。</p></details></section>
<section data-panel="activity" hidden><div class="section"><h2>活动方式</h2><p class="tooltip" id="life-status">正在准备独立活动…</p><div class="behaviors"><button class="selected" data-behavior="auto">自然活动</button><button data-behavior="idle">停步观察</button><button data-behavior="walk">持续行走</button><button data-behavior="alert">举螯警戒</button><button data-behavior="forage">停稳探索</button><button data-behavior="rest">静止</button></div><div class="stage-note"><p class="bodytext">沙滩模式下，普通蟹侧行，椰子蟹前行。关节受限，步速随脚步能力变化；停稳后再探索或警戒。暂停和速度在画面下方。</p><button data-stage="beach" class="plain-button">进入沙滩 · 恢复自然活动</button></div><p class="note">动作参考自然行为；关节范围是保守工程约束，真实生物活动范围尚未实测。</p></div></section>
<section data-panel="rig" hidden><div class="section"><h2>椰子蟹 · 区块与关节</h2><p class="tooltip">检查关节时可切到骨骼工作台；形体与绑定数据保持。</p><button data-stage="lab" class="plain-button">进入骨骼工作台</button><select id="region-select" aria-label="椰子蟹解剖区块"><option value="-1">显示全部区块</option></select><p class="bodytext" id="region-info" style="white-space:pre-line">正在读取区块归属…</p><button id="clear-region">取消区块选择</button><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="joint-test">单关节测试</label><div class="control"><label for="joint-angle">关节角度</label><input id="joint-angle" type="range" min="-9" max="9" step="1" value="0" disabled><span id="joint-angle-value">0°</span></div><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="skeleton">显示骨架</label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="wire">显示网格</label><p class="tooltip">刚性甲壳与未确认结构锁定；测试范围不代表生物最大活动角。</p></div></section>
<section data-panel="view" hidden><div class="section"><h2>观察视角</h2><div class="views"><button class="selected" data-view="perspective">透视</button><button data-view="front">正面</button><button data-view="back">背面</button><button data-view="left">左侧</button><button data-view="right">右侧</button><button data-view="top">顶部</button><button data-view="bottom">腹部</button></div><p class="tooltip">点顶部“普通螃蟹”或“椰子蟹”可跟随并放大一只；“两只一起”回到沙滩全景。</p><div class="metrics">普通蟹骨骼：<b id="ordinary-joints">—</b><br>椰子蟹骨骼：<b id="coconut-joints">—</b><br>完整三角面：<b id="triangles">—</b></div></div></section>
<div class="panel-footer"><p class="note">R11-behavior-contact-20261001 · 本机实时三维工作台<br>保留来源权利 · 用户视觉验收待确认</p></div></div></aside></div><script>window.PAYLOAD={"ordinarySurface":"","ordinaryRig":"